---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';

const updated = 'November 2026';
---

<Page title="Now" description="What Giovanni Hale is working on, studying, and building right now.">
	<p class="label">Now · updated {updated}</p>
	<h1>What I'm focused on</h1>
	<div class="prose">
		<h2>Working</h2>
		<p>
			Systems administrator on a fully remote contract. Day to day that means Google Workspace
			administration, device management in Intune with some Apple Business Manager, patching, and
			Jira and Confluence administration.
		</p>
		<p>
			Most of my background is Microsoft 365, so Google Workspace admin is new ground. I'm learning
			it the way I learn any system: find out where everything lives, then write it down.
		</p>

		<h2>Studying</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>CompTIA CySA+</strong>, targeting April 2027.</li>
			<li>Next: Google's Generative AI Leader certification.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Building</h2>
		<p>
			This site. Astro, deployed to Cloudflare Workers from a public GitHub repo, built with free
			tools only. <a href="/notes/building-this-site/">Field Note 001</a> covers how and why.
		</p>

		<hr />
		<p class="label">
			This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">now page</a>. If you're reading it long after the
			date above, I've probably moved on to something new.
		</p>
	</div>
</Page>
